  {
    "content": "Scene 1.2 “The Nets”, the changed paragraphs
Typed: POV r1 · place r4 · year 1811
Card now: Tomas sells the map; Orrin hears it. · where the quay · POV r1

Known about the records named here:
r1 eyes “grey” · hair “red”
r2 age “forty”

Secrets and threads here:
s1 the sold map: r3 overheard 1.1 (from r2); r2 knew before 1.1

Facts listed from these paragraphs:
c1 r3 knows s1 overheard from r2 ¶1

Paragraphs:
¶0 Tomas sold the map on the quay.
